            <ArticleTitle>Electrohysterography may be integral to remifentanil labor analgesia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>151-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.3109/14767058.2011.565836</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Electrohysterography can give the obstetric anesthesiologists a promising parameter to synchronize labor pain relief with remifentanil when patients do not want or cannot have labor epidurals due to their preferences against epidurals or anatomical difficulties in epidural placements.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
